  "description": "Arturia MiniFreak polyphonic hybrid synthesizer: every controller of its manual's MIDI implementation chart.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "MiniFreak User Manual 4.0.1",
      "notes": "MIDI CC chart (pages 121, 122 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/arturia/read-arturia-cc.mjs from minifreak_Manual_4_0_1_EN.pdf (sha256 a90b60d85a54b01dbb350d335671c42b228a789ed53928c71ea5a8c6daf361d0), https://dl.arturia.net/products/minifreak/manual/minifreak_Manual_4_0_1_EN.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/arturia/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/arturia/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI CC chart, with its printed name, sent as a control change on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The chart prints controller numbers only: every value is the controller's 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a waveform, an oscillator type) is a number here, not a choice.",
    "Rows grouped by the layout, not where the chart prints them: CC 5 Glide (printed under Pedals).",
    "Left out, the wheels, ribbon and pedals: CC 1 Mod Wheel, CC 64 Sustain."
  ],
